    "rules": [
      "The website intake never creates property, deal, investor, financing or underwriting records.",
      "Existing generic company and contact deduplication retains precedence.",
      "The vertical never overwrites manually curated generic CRM fields.",
      "A real-estate deal must reference an existing or separately human-created generic opportunity.",
      "Removal of the vertical must not alter the generic CRM."
